{"id":51700,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51700"},"modified":"2026-10-22T21:44:39","modified_gmt":"2026-10-22T20:44:39","slug":"sao-silvestre-de-lagoa-credito-agricola-acores","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-de-lagoa-credito-agricola-acores\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Lagoa | Cr\u00e9dito Agr\u00edcola A\u00e7ores 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Lagoa | Cr\u00e9dito Agr\u00edcola A\u00e7ores 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Lagoa | Cr\u00e9dito Agr\u00edcola A\u00e7ores 2026<\/strong> (9\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre Cidade de Lagoa) realiza-se no dia <strong>27 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (domingo), na <strong>Cidade de Lagoa<\/strong>, na ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel (<strong>A\u00e7ores<\/strong>). Com abertura oficial das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es agendada para o dia <strong>1 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, esta cl\u00e1ssica de fim de ano re\u00fane atletas e popula\u00e7\u00e3o geral nas ruas do concelho a\u00e7oriano.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Inserida no ambiente festivo da quadra natal\u00edcia na costa sul da ilha de <strong>S\u00e3o Miguel<\/strong>, a <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre Cidade de Lagoa<\/strong> percorre a malha urbana de um munic\u00edpio hist\u00f3rico conhecido pela sua tradi\u00e7\u00e3o oleira, miradouros costeiros sobre o Atl\u00e2ntico e piscinas naturais vulc\u00e2nicas. O evento \u00e9 destinado \u00e0 popula\u00e7\u00e3o em geral e tem como miss\u00e3o estimular a pr\u00e1tica desportiva regular enquanto elemento essencial de promo\u00e7\u00e3o da sa\u00fade e da qualidade de vida na comunidade.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo do <strong>CDOL &#8211; Clube Desportivo Oper\u00e1rio de Lagoa<\/strong>, em estreita colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com a <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Lagoa<\/strong> e com o patroc\u00ednio da <strong>Caixa Cr\u00e9dito Agr\u00edcola M\u00fatuo dos A\u00e7ores<\/strong>. Prepara a tua prova com a nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">27 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Cidade de Lagoa, Lagoa, A\u00e7ores<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre Cidade de Lagoa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">CDOL &#8211; Clube Desportivo Oper\u00e1rio de Lagoa e C\u00e2mara Municipal de Lagoa<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre Cidade de Lagoa<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 27 Dez<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Lagoa | Cr\u00e9dito Agr\u00edcola A\u00e7ores 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 9\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da S\u00e3o Silvestre Cidade de Lagoa realiza-se no domingo, dia 27 de dezembro de 2026, na cidade de Lagoa, ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel, nos A\u00e7ores.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando abrem as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e quando ser\u00e1 publicado o regulamento oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A data da edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2026 (27 de dezembro) j\u00e1 \u00e9 oficial e a abertura das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e1 confirmada para o dia 1 de novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 00:00. O regulamento definitivo, os hor\u00e1rios detalhados de partida e a tabela de pre\u00e7os ser\u00e3o publicados aquando da abertura oficial das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde decorre a prova e a quem se destina?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre no concelho de Lagoa (A\u00e7ores) e destina-se \u00e0 popula\u00e7\u00e3o em geral, visando incentivar a atividade f\u00edsica, a sa\u00fade e o conv\u00edvio desportivo no encerramento do ano.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora da 9\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre Cidade de Lagoa?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pelo CDOL &#8211; Clube Desportivo Oper\u00e1rio de Lagoa, contando com a colabora\u00e7\u00e3o institucional da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Lagoa e o patroc\u00ednio da Caixa Cr\u00e9dito Agr\u00edcola M\u00fatuo dos A\u00e7ores.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar os resultados e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Lagoa?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Ap\u00f3s a realiza\u00e7\u00e3o da prova a 27 de dezembro de 2026, todos os resultados e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es poder\u00e3o ser consultados no portal Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Lagoa | Cr\u00e9dito Agr\u00edcola A\u00e7ores 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-27\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-27\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Cidade de Lagoa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lagoa\", \"addressRegion\": \"A\u00e7ores\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A 9\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de Lagoa Cr\u00e9dito Agr\u00edcola A\u00e7ores 2026 realiza-se a 27 de dezembro em Lagoa, S\u00e3o Miguel. Consulta o guia oficial e garante a tua inscri\u00e7\u00e3o!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-sao-silvestre-de-lagoa-credito-agricola-acores-1.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/ss-lagoa-2026\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\"}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"CDOL - Clube Desportivo Oper\u00e1rio de Lagoa e C\u00e2mara Municipal de Lagoa\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Lagoa | Cr\u00e9dito Agr\u00edcola A\u00e7ores 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 9\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da S\u00e3o Silvestre Cidade de Lagoa realiza-se no domingo, dia 27 de dezembro de 